                                    <td colspan="4" style="text-align: right !important; padding: 6px 10px !important; color: #1e40af !important; font-size: 0.78rem !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;">
                                        Grand Totals:
